- `max-test-assertions` (python, rust): Limits the number of assertions in one test function.
- `no-assertion-packing` (python, rust): Flags assertions that pack several checks into one condition.
- `no-mock-assertions` (python): Flags assertions on how a mock was called in Python tests.
- `no-mocks-in-tests` (python): Flags dynamic mocks and monkeypatching in Python tests.
- `no-sleep-in-tests` (python, rust): Flags fixed-duration sleeps in tests.
- `no-zero-sleep-in-tests` (python, rust): Flags zero-duration sleeps used to yield in tests.

